steps.text:
Each treatment leaves a clue:
• under the <b>loupe</b> and the <b>microscope</b>: resin in the cracks, laser holes, gas bubbles, colour concentrated in the cracks;
• under <b>UV</b>: an unusual glow, like an oil or a resin that shines;
• in the <b>infrared</b>: the peaks of oil and resin;
• in the <b>spectroscope</b>: lines that are missing or added;
• in the <b>dichroscope</b> and the <b>Chelsea</b>: a colour that does not match the stone.

No instrument is enough alone: you gather the clues.
